{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "month": "2026-11",
  "version": "4bcabda863cb",
  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "2026-11-01",
      "date": "2026-11-01",
      "text": "松树千年终是朽，槿花一日自为荣。",
      "author": "白居易",
      "source": "放言五首·其五",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "vertical",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/d2aoMA.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-27-964c0f7e825c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-02",
      "date": "2026-11-02",
      "text": "其实失去，只是痛那么一下而已；如果不这么痛一下，怎么会知道这痛其实不算什么。",
      "author": "乔奢费",
      "source": "铠甲勇士",
      "category": "台词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "excerpt",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/0PJtZg.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-04-c9553aae960f.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-03",
      "date": "2026-11-03",
      "text": "总有一天，我要让这里座无虚席！",
      "author": "高坂穗乃果",
      "source": "LoveLive!!",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "collage",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/LJea9A.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-39-b218cd4d5171.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-04",
      "date": "2026-11-04",
      "text": "唯有扑入磅礴的千疮百孔的世界，去经历风霜和抚摸土地，贫瘠才可能成为真正滋养我们的东西。就好像，那曾经一心叛逃的故乡，在一次次落笔中回到眼前，竟给予了我们最多的馈赠和安慰。",
      "author": "沈熹微",
      "source": "在人群中消失的日子",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "ticket",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/cDP0Kg.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-28-7e4f45fda232.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-05",
      "date": "2026-11-05",
      "text": "可见，明白道理是一回事，眼睁睁面对道理又是另外一回事，道理像远看的珠宝非常悦目，但当从远处掷来而狠狠击中了身体，道理亦是石头，会让人痛彻心扉。",
      "author": "马家辉",
      "source": "龙头凤尾",
      "category": "小说",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "book",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/xacMbg.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-20-0992c57e80e1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-06",
      "date": "2026-11-06",
      "text": "春色满园关不住，一枝红杏出墙来。",
      "author": "叶绍翁",
      "source": "游园不值",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "horizon",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/V9tBaA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-21-ac26c9221322.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-07",
      "date": "2026-11-07",
      "text": "真理是普遍的，它不属于我一个人，而为大家所有；真理占有我，而不是我占有真理。我只有构成我的精神个性的形式。",
      "author": "马克思",
      "source": "评普鲁士最近的书报检查令",
      "category": "语录",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "type",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/Mu6FGw.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-05-ef4a815dabf1.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-08",
      "date": "2026-11-08",
      "text": "千载流年一如梦，月落山河一世倾。",
      "author": "瓶子",
      "source": "灵契",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "light",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/aEzPaA.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-38-e7a4cd9d235c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-09",
      "date": "2026-11-09",
      "text": "黄金是璃月的财富。但璃月真正的财富，是璃月的人们那如黄金般闪耀的心灵。",
      "author": "钟离",
      "source": "原神",
      "category": "游戏",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "poster",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 2,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/yRtUMw.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-23-6bd14e015e7e.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-10",
      "date": "2026-11-10",
      "text": "世界上有太多孤独的人，都害怕走出第一步。",
      "author": "Tony Vallelonga",
      "source": "绿皮书",
      "category": "台词",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "photo",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/k7kxtA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-07-968a33c8a8bb.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-11",
      "date": "2026-11-11",
      "text": "遏制自己内心的知识优越感，才能让你发自内心的去尊重他人，避免狂妄自大，才能让你不断的丰富自己的内心。",
      "author": "罗翔",
      "source": "罗翔语录",
      "category": "语录",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "excerpt",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/b4Cl7A.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-37-b5b58258072a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-12",
      "date": "2026-11-12",
      "text": "草在结它的种子，风在摇它的叶子，我们站着，不说话，就十分美好。",
      "author": "顾城",
      "source": "门前",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "paper",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/NkhyqQ.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-15-f672740d4a53.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-13",
      "date": "2026-11-13",
      "text": "查理大帝说，“既然您不存在，您如何履行职责呢？”“凭借意志的力量，”阿季卢尔福说，“以及对我们神圣事业的忠诚！”“对，对，说得好，正是应当这样来履行自己的义务。好，好一个机敏的不存在的人！”",
      "author": "卡尔维诺",
      "source": "不存在的骑士",
      "category": "小说",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "letter",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/89n6GQ.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-1793794949153-b342b5bf60b6.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-14",
      "date": "2026-11-14",
      "text": "我不如起个磨刀石的作用，能使钢刀锋利，虽然它自己切不动什么。",
      "author": "贺拉斯",
      "source": "诗艺",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "vertical",
      "font": "mashanzheng",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/Sax5ZA.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-01-6ec68b9d0eff.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-15",
      "date": "2026-11-15",
      "text": "那一年我二十一岁，在我一生的黄金时代，我有好多奢望：我想爱，想吃，还想在一瞬间变成天上半明半暗的云。",
      "author": "王小波",
      "source": "黄金时代",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "horizon",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/xp335g.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-13-685086481a18.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-16",
      "date": "2026-11-16",
      "text": "不管是烈火还是深海，都取不走我的命。",
      "author": "海洋之灾·普朗克",
      "source": "英雄联盟",
      "category": "游戏",
      "background": "sea",
      "template": "poster",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/8A7a5A.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-19-7f27be710b03.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-17",
      "date": "2026-11-17",
      "text": "有一位医生曾将上海比喻为大清帝国的脸色。这个老大帝国身体一旦有什么不妥，上海必现表征。",
      "author": "马伯庸",
      "source": "大医·破晓篇",
      "category": "小说",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "split",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/IfWbXg.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-30-1dd8655c9a80.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-18",
      "date": "2026-11-18",
      "text": "如果我们能够活着回去，万水千山你愿意陪我一起看吗？",
      "author": "庹小新",
      "source": "狐妖小红娘",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "sea",
      "template": "light",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/HGskxw.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-40-056916f9a682.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-19",
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "text": "我眺望远方的山峰，却错过转弯的路口，蓦然回首，才发现你在等我，没离开过。",
      "author": "楼南蔚",
      "source": "没离开过",
      "category": "台词",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "photo",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/2cQIzg.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-17-383a010c7bc2.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-20",
      "date": "2026-11-20",
      "text": "秋阴不散霜飞晚，留得枯荷听雨声。",
      "author": "李商隐",
      "source": "宿骆氏亭寄怀崔雍崔衮",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "moon",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/d2aoMA.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-27-964c0f7e825c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-21",
      "date": "2026-11-21",
      "text": "人之所以成为人，正是因为我们生活在文明社会中，每时每刻受到他人的影响。",
      "author": "艾略特·阿伦森",
      "source": "社会性动物",
      "category": "语录",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "paper",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/0PJtZg.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-04-c9553aae960f.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-22",
      "date": "2026-11-22",
      "text": "那天，我听到了种子破土的声音，又细微又坚定。",
      "author": "夏达",
      "source": "子不语",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "collage",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/cDP0Kg.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-28-7e4f45fda232.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-23",
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "text": "那么，让我们都做一张丝薄的纸吧，在水墨中清浅，缓缓洇开的，是尘世中最简单的幸福。",
      "author": "白落梅",
      "source": "相逢如初见，回首是一生",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "window",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/VI4wbQ.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-06-b0f43fbd1ce4.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-24",
      "date": "2026-11-24",
      "text": "月之民不会就这样居住在污秽附近，他们一定会逃往梦境之类的地方。",
      "author": "ZUN",
      "source": "东方绀珠传",
      "category": "游戏",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "light",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/SCJz1Q.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/quiet-coast-09aa4adfcd5f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-25",
      "date": "2026-11-25",
      "text": "但是必须去生活，领取角色，陷入爱恨，必须去渺小，オ能结实。离开吧，即便自我监禁之地永远是故乡，即便在这牢房中以幻想的光速占领过宇宙。",
      "author": "刘天昭",
      "source": "无中生有",
      "category": "小说",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "ticket",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/tF1Xig.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-08-59f6f87d0f11.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-26",
      "date": "2026-11-26",
      "text": "成事不说，遂事不谏，既往不咎。",
      "author": "孔子",
      "source": "论语",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "vertical",
      "font": "mashanzheng",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/mwmaug.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-26-7479b46dae18.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-27",
      "date": "2026-11-27",
      "text": "谁要在人际关系中选择放弃，那么，因为他拥有了一个基准点，从而能够相对于它而不那么看重自己，所以他至少部分地像神秘主义者一样行事。",
      "author": "图根德哈特",
      "source": "自我中心性与神秘主义",
      "category": "语录",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "type",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/pWsvlg.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-1793792546422-852a19f8e2c6.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-28",
      "date": "2026-11-28",
      "text": "我一看有人提着包离开这个城市，别管他去哪，我都很羡慕。",
      "author": "李樯",
      "source": "立春",
      "category": "台词",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "ticket",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/KWlfaQ.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/rain-window-1880d108ec47.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-29",
      "date": "2026-11-29",
      "text": "文明社会强调美感、清洁、秩序，而活在文明社会的人必须俯首称臣，压抑自己的本能冲动并且追求文化理想。",
      "author": "弗洛伊德",
      "source": "文明及其不满",
      "category": "语录",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "split",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/xumyVg.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-18-41a05ce888b7.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-30",
      "date": "2026-11-30",
      "text": "凝霜灿雪偃月刀，鲜衣怒马少年郎。",
      "author": "大帅",
      "source": "三国杀",
      "category": "游戏",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "poster",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/NkhyqQ.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-15-f672740d4a53.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
